mindmap
  root((Operator Overloading))
    Binary Operators
      Arithmetic: + - * / %
      Relational: == != < > <= >=
      Assignment: = += -= *= /=
      Logical: && || !
    Unary Operators
      Increment: ++ prefix/postfix
      Decrement: -- prefix/postfix
      Dereference: * ->
      Negation: !
    Friend Functions
      Non-member overloads
      Access private members
      Typical for << >>
    Stream Operators
      operator<< ostream
      operator>> istream
      Chaining returns reference
    Conversion Operators
      operator type conversion
      explicit keyword C++ 11
    Rules and Restrictions
      At least one user-defined type
      Cannot create new operators
      Precedence and associativity fixed
      No short-circuit for overloaded && ||
      . :: ?: sizeof cannot overload
